 "summary": "Good energy in the arms and a clean loop seam, but it is not yet a run: there is no flight phase, the stance foot is buried in the floor at mid-stance and skates, the hip hyper-extends to 40 deg, and the knee and thigh pop through the recovery. The upper body is keyed in lockstep on frame 10. Fixes: rebuilt stance and recovery leg poses, flat-foot contact with a toe roll, a keyed flight arc with the root planted during stance, pumping elbows and staggered upper body.",
